            <div class="project-header">
                <a href="https://github.com/sku0x20/stopgap" target="_blank">stopgap</a>
                <span class="muted">Kotlin · Maven Central</span>
            </div>
            <p>Microservice framework on Helidon SE (Nima) + Project Loom. Custom compile-time DI via KSP — no runtime reflection. Three-tier testing: unit → in-process integration server → Docker E2E via Testcontainers. Gradle plugin that wires the full build pipeline. Published at <code>dev.sku20.stopgap:*:2.8.0</code>.</p>
        </div>

