    <section class="publications">
        <h2>Publications</h2>
        <div class="project">
            <div class="project-header">
                <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21717242" target="_blank">Connection-Agnostic Presence Tracking for Stateless Distributed Backends</a>
                <span class="muted">Preprint · Zenodo</span>
            </div>
            <p>Redis-based architecture for tracking IoT device online/offline status across stateless distributed backends — sorted sets scored by expiry deadlines, throttled batch writes, asymmetric fault-tolerance guarantees ensuring offline transitions are never lost. Derives worst-case detection latency bounds. v1.3.0.</p>
